{"book":"leviticus","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T10:44:48.862143860Z","verse":24,"ref":"leviticus 20:24","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":20,"translation":"And I said to you, ⟨you⟩ shall inherit ⟨את⟩ their land, and I—I will give her to you to possess ⟨את⟩ her, a land flowing with milk and honey. I ⟨am⟩ YHWH your Elohim, who separated ⟨את⟩ you from the peoples.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואמר","gloss":"And I said"},{"surface":"לכם","gloss":"to you"},{"surface":"אתם","gloss":"⟨you⟩"},{"surface":"תירשו","gloss":"shall inherit"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"their land"},{"surface":"אדמתם","gloss":"their land"},{"surface":"ואני","gloss":"and I"},{"surface":"אתננה","gloss":"I will give her"},{"surface":"לכם","gloss":"to you"},{"surface":"לרשת","gloss":"to possess"},{"surface":"אתה","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"her (the land)"},{"surface":"ארץ","gloss":"a land"},{"surface":"זבת","gloss":"flowing"},{"surface":"חלב","gloss":"with milk"},{"surface":"ודבש","gloss":"and honey"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"I"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"YHWH"},{"surface":"אלהיכם","gloss":"your Elohim"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"who"},{"surface":"הבדלתי","gloss":"separated"},{"surface":"אתכם","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"you"},{"surface":"מן","gloss":"from"},{"surface":"העמים","gloss":"the peoples"}]}